xt-raise:0pt;\">: 2026</span><span style=\"font-family:한양신명조;mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;\">년 파란사다리 사업</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">  </span><span style=\"font-family:한양신명조;mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;\">나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">.</span><span style=\"font-family:한양신명조;mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;\">사업목적</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">:</span><span style=\"font-family:한양신명조;mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;\">경제</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">·</span><span style=\"font-family:한양신명조;mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;\">사회적 취약계층 대학생을 대상으로 해외 진로탐색 경험을 제공</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">  </span><span style=\"font-family:한양신명조;mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;\">다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">.</span><span style=\"font-family:한양신명조;mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;\">사업구성</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">:</span><span style=\"font-family:한양신명조;mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;\">해외진로탐색활동</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:한양신명조;mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;\">어학연수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">+</span><span style=\"font-family:한양신명조;mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;\">직무연수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">+</span><span style=\"font-family:한양신명조;mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;\">기업탐방</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">+</span><span style=\"font-family:한양신명조;mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;\">명사특강</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">+</span><span style=\"font-family:한양신명조;mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;\">진로워크숍 </span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">          </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">+</span><span style=\"font-family:한양신명조;mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;\">팀미션 활동</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">+</span><span style=\"font-family:한양신명조;mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;\">문화체험</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">  </span><span style=\"font-family:한양신명조;mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;\">라</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">.</span><span style=\"font-family:한양신명조;mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;\">지원대상</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">:</span><span style=\"font-family:한양신명조;mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;\">대구</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">,</span><span style=\"font-family:한양신명조;mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;\">경북권역</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family:한양신명조;mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;\">년</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">, 4</span><span style=\"font-family:한양신명조;mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;\">년제 대학교 재학생 중 소득분위 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">6</span><span style=\"font-family:한양신명조;mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;\">구간 이하</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">  </span><span style=\"font-family:한양신명조;mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;\">마</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">.</span><span style=\"font-family:한양신명조;mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;\">지원내용</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">:</span><span style=\"font-family:한양신명조;mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;\">항공운임</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">,</span><span style=\"font-family:한양신명조;mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;\">국내교육비</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">,</span><span style=\"font-family:한양신명조;mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;\">현지연수비</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">,</span><span style=\"font-family:한양신명조;mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;\">현지숙박비 등 전액</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">   </span><span style=\"font-family:한양신명조;mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">※</span><span style=\"font-family:한양신명조;mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;\">현지교통비 및 현지식비는 학생 자부담</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">  </span><span style=\"font-family:한양신명조;mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;\">바</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;mso-font-width: